# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Linux/Vulkan port
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# `[Bb]uild/` above catches build/ but not the side-by-side trees this port
# uses, and those are 1.8 GB each. build/binhist/ inside them holds 55 MB
# Orbiter binaries kept by Tests/input/session.sh so a core dump stays
# readable after a rebuild -- useful locally, never in the history.
build-*/
out/

# Screenshots. _shots/ is where every harness drops its captures (524 MB and
# growing); the loose crop*/full*/shot* files at the root are the same thing
# from earlier sessions.
_shots/
crop*.png
full*.png
shot*.png

# Runtime state written into the source tree by a run.
Orbiter.log
imgui.ini
